vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">甲骨文披露2026财年裁员2.1万人，支付18.4亿美元离职补偿金</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">火山引擎发布Seedance 2.5视频模型与豆包2.1 Pro大模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">影眸科技完成数亿元新一轮融资并发布千万面级3D大模型Rodin Gen-2.5</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯QQ邮箱上线AI专属邮箱服务Agently Mail并开启内测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ad3c563db43f33bac7713c4568446b63.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯QQ邮箱正式上线专为AI智能体打造的专属邮箱服务Agently Mail并开启内测。该服务为每个Agent分配独立且与个人邮箱物理隔离的地址，通过实名认证及用户确认机制，解决AI操作个人邮箱带来的隐私与安全风险。Agently Mail支持AI自主注册第三方平台、接收验证码，并实现企业间A2A（Agent to Agent）自动通信，支持询价、报价及订单对接等商务流程。在安全性上，系统内置Prompt注入防护，所有操作均可追溯。目前，该服务已适配Cursor、Claude Code、Kimi、豆包超能模式等主流AI Agent，用户通过CLI工具及微信扫码即可完成授权。Agently Mail已在GitHub以Apache-2.0协议开源，支持发票归集、简历投递及订单对账等自动化办公场景，旨在为AI提供安全</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百川智能发布医疗增强大模型Baichuan-M4，实现主动问诊与全病程记忆</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cbfc59096efac124e295d3ead49afcbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百川智能联手清华大学发布医疗增强大模型Baichuan-M4，在HealthBench及其Hard、Professional榜单中位居榜首，医疗专业能力超越GPT-5.5。该模型核心突破在于交互模式的变革，具备模拟真人医生的主动追问能力，能自主识别病情线索。技术层面，M4引入“全病程记忆”功能，深度整合历史病历、化验指标及用药反馈，确保诊疗连贯性。此外，其采用“证据锚定”技术，使医学结论能精确对应权威临床指南或论文，循证引用精度达90.0。Baichuan-M4的发布标志着大模型从知识储备向诊疗决策支持跨越，通过提升复杂病例推理能力，为医疗资源稀缺地区提供可靠诊断参考，推动医疗行业智能化转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">甲骨文披露2026财年裁员2.1万人，支付18.4亿美元离职补偿金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/273d5f15835d88f2e3c6d7dee4134883.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">甲骨文最新年报显示，2026财年公司员工总数从约16.2万人降至14.1万人，裁员规模达2.1万人，降幅为13%。为推进组织架构调整与AI战略转型，甲骨文为此支出18.4亿美元（约125亿元人民币）离职补偿及相关成本，较上一财年增长近五倍。公司称裁员由管理层调整、绩效评估、战略转向及收购整合等多重因素驱动。作为云计算领域的追赶者，甲骨文近期通过与OpenAI、Meta签署数据中心合作协议以强化竞争力，但面临巨大的资金压力。公司预计本财年净资本开支约700亿美元，计划通过债务和股权融资筹措400亿美元。在全球科技行业裁员潮背景下，2026年已有196家企业累计裁员超11.98万人，显示出AI技术带来的效率提升与成本替代效应正加速重塑行业人力结构。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">火山引擎发布Seedance 2.5视频模型与豆包2.1 Pro大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d93dd873b646597c4255e318411d831e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月23日，字节跳动火山引擎FORCE原动力大会发布多款AI产品。核心亮点视频生成模型Seedance 2.5实现单次直出30秒完整视频，支持3D白模及更高参考素材容量，显著提升长视频叙事连贯性与工业级生产效率。同期发布的豆包Seed 2.1系列模型（含Pro版）能力对标Opus 4.6，其中豆包2.1 Pro支持2小时视频观看及端到端视频剪辑，强化了长上下文理解与任务处理能力。此外，图像模型Seeddream 5.0同步亮相，与Seedance及豆包系列形成多模态协同。字节跳动将推出豆包专业版及办公产品，旨在加速AI Agent在企业办公与内容创作场景的落地，推动多模态AI技术在工业生产中的应用升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">影眸科技完成数亿元新一轮融资并发布千万面级3D大模型Rodin Gen-2.5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ae445e3823092b64e57a8de65609c984.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">影眸科技近日宣布完成数亿元人民币新一轮融资，由凯辉基金、上海国投先导领投，资金将用于3D大模型研发及全球商业化拓展。同步发布的Hyper3D Rodin Gen-2.5模型引入“先思考、再生成”逻辑，具备千万面级生成能力，最快4秒可生成百万面模型，并支持12K原生3D贴图。该产品主打B端及专业C端市场，海外收入占比达80%，客户涵盖字节跳动、Unity等巨头。作为以Rodin大模型为引擎的核心产品，Hyper3D此前生成的3D画面曾被英伟达CEO黄仁勋用于CES 2026机器人业务展示。数据显示，该产品上线首月订阅用户与ARR环比增速均超400%。此次技术升级不仅强化了影眸科技在3D生成式AI赛道的地位，也为具身智能等垂直场景构建“世界模型”提供了关键技术支撑。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
